// PIN (part): a gated `~[flag]part` whose flag IS set is a real declaration
// — the loud-miss rule survives the gate (declared tag, no file → KORU201,
// the same refusal `~part ghost` makes). Gating removes the declaration;
// it never weakens it.

~[partgate]part ghost

~pub tor show { v: u32 }

~proc show|zig { std.debug.print("unreachable\n", .{}); }

~show(v: 1)
